{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh- hey, hey, you okay? are you hurt? you look like you've seen a ghost","Hi, hi there, you alright? you're not bitten, are you? you're not hurt?","Hey, I- hello, can I help you? do you need something? are you lost?","Hi! Sorry, I saw you and thought... maybe you wanted someone to talk to?","H-hello -- are you alone? are you okay? I'm so sorry, I'm just worried"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hey, you, how are you holding up? you look rough","Hello there... everything okay? you need anything?","Hi, friend, you alright? you look like you could use a breather","Hey... hey, come here, sit a minute, you look done in","You okay? you need water? a bandage? a minute?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Hey, you! I was hoping I'd see you, how are you doing? really?","Oh, it's you! I'm so glad, come, sit, tell me everything","Hello, my friend, how's the world treating you?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"You, stop, what do you want?","State your business, and make it quick","Hey, you, yeah, you, what are you doing here?","What do you want?","Yes?","You've got something to say, say it","You need something?","I'm listening","Talk"},false,false,{[4]={{t="and don't say \"nothing\"",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="say it from there!",afterMs=2800}},[7]={{t="because I'm NOT offering!",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="don't make me regret it",afterMs=2800}},[9]={{t="hands where I can see 'em",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Hey, hey, it's late, you shouldn't be out here, are you alright?","Shh... hi, are you okay? what are you doing up at this hour?"}},
