{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Hey, you! stop a minute, I wanted to see how you're doing","Oh, it's you! I'm so glad, come, talk to me, how are you?","There you are! do you need anything? water? a bandage? a minute?","Hello again, how've you been holding up? really?","Hey, stranger, I mean friend, how's the day treating you?","Come here a second, I've been meaning to say thank you","Hi, hi, are you hurt? are you hungry? tell me, don't be shy","Oh good, you're alive, and walking, and talking, what a relief","Hey, got a minute? I could use a friendly voice","Hi there, you look thin, have you eaten today?","Friend! it's good to see you, tell me everything","Well, hello, good to see you on your feet, how are you really?","Hey, you, everything alright? I worry about you, I do","I've been hoping to run into you -- how are you?","Hi, I wanted to say, folks like you are why I keep going","Hey, you! are you cold? hungry? scared? talk to me","Hello there, you're always welcome, you know that, what's up?","Oh thank goodness, I was getting lonely, how are you?","Hey, I saved you a seat, c'mon, sit","Hi, friend, anything on your mind? I've got time","Hey, you look like you've got a story, I've got time to hear it","Come on over, we haven't talked in a while, how are things?","Hello! how's the world treating you today?","Hey, you look rough, sit, what do you need?","Oh, it's you, that's the best thing that's happened to me all day","Hey, you doing okay? you can tell me, I'm a good listener","Hi, how're you holding up, really?","Pull up a seat, tell me what's going on in your world"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=4,11",{"Hey, I thought of you this morning, you doing okay?"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"What do you want NOW?","You, again, what is it?","Make it fast, I don't have time for you!","Whatever it is, I'm not interested","You're making me nervous, state your business","Keep it short, and keep your hands where I can see them!","Why are you hovering? say something or leave","I'm watching you, so don't try anything!","Yes? What? Hurry up!","I don't like how you're looking at me","What now?","Spit it out, or get lost!","Don't come any closer, say what you have to say from there","I'm busy, so make it quick","I didn't ask for company, but here you are","What is it? what do you want from me?","Oh great, it's you, what do you need?","I've got nothing for you, so don't ask","You've got thirty seconds, go","Look, I'll HEAR you out, but I don't have to like it","Make your point, then make yourself scarce","I'm listening, against my better judgment","Whatever you're selling, I'm not buying","What do you want? quick -- before I change my mind","Talk, and NO funny business","You have my attention, unfortunately","Let's make this quick -- shall we?","I'm only talking to you because I have to","What? What is it?","Don't waste my time","Say it and go","I'd rather not, but go ahead, what is it?!"}},
{"NPC_OPEN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Oh? What do you want? Make it quick, I'm busy","Well, look who stopped to talk, what do you want?","You've got my attention, for about a minute, so make it count","Yeah? What's on your mind, stranger?","Talk, I'm listening, but my finger's on the trigger"}},
